# Photo mode as a free camera: no height limit, no 100 m leash, no ceiling/floor, no collision with the car or world
PhotoModeCam\MaxHeight 1000
PhotoModeCam\BoundaryCylinderRadius 100000
PhotoModeCam\BoundaryCeilingHeight 5000
PhotoModeCam\BoundaryFloorDepth 5000
PhotoModeCam\CollisionFixIterations 0
PhotoModeCam\CollisionSphereRadius 0.01
PhotoModeCam\CarBoundingBoxHorizontalExpansion 0
PhotoModeCam\CarBoundingBoxVerticalExpansion 0
